===============================================
Random bits of code written by Jonathan Halcrow
===============================================

ngram_markov
	A script that generates random words using a Markov chain over ngrams
	of characters.

mondrian
      Some functions implementing the Mondrian Process

oldschool_12bolt
	A Monte Carlo "playtest" simulator for an Atlantic 93/94 Old School
	12 Bolt (URw Lion Dib Bolt) deck, used to pick the flex slots for
	the LOBSTERCON 2026 main event. Decklist and results in DECK.md.
